sentences.text:
By applying the multiplier of 17, the tribunal worked out the amount of compensation for loss of life as Rs.5,10,000/-, upon which a further sum of Rs.2,000/-
for funeral expenses, Rs.2,000/- for loss of estate and Rs.2,000/- for case expenses, was added,
totaling compensation payable to the claimants at Rs.5,17,000/-.
